  "zip_caveats": "ZIPs do not map to ballots. Kevin's 78702 is split between Council Districts 1 and 3 and between AISD trustee districts; all of it is HD-51, CD-37, Commissioner Pct 4 and JP/Constable 4, but confirm with the Travis County voter lookup. 78717, 78728, 78729 and 78750 are partly in Williamson County (Williamson voters get a Williamson ballot: Wilco county judge, clerk, Round Rock or Leander ISD). 78737, 78739 and 78747 touch Hays County. 78745 to 78749 and 78735 are split between Council Districts 5 and 8. 78704 is split among Districts 3, 5 and 9. 78731, 78746 and 78733 reach into Eanes or Lake Travis ISD, which have no race on this ballot. Congressional lines were redrawn in 2025: central Austin is CD-37, east and southeast Travis is CD-27 or CD-10, and far west and northwest Travis is CD-11; check your registration card or the voter lookup.",
