  "notes": "Any Travis County voter can use any Travis polling place, early or on Election Day. Seven early-voting sites stay open until 10 PM on Oct 29 and 30. Travis also has a generic consolidated ballot PDF at votetravis.gov showing every contest in the county. Travis County: moved here from another Texas county and didn't re-register? You may be able to vote a limited ballot, but only at the Travis County Elections office, 5501 Airport Blvd., during early voting (through Oct 30); call 512-238-8683 first. Have a Travis mail ballot? On Election Day only, 7 AM to 7 PM, you can hand it in yourself, with photo ID, at 5501 Airport Blvd. Mail ballot questions: ebbm@traviscountytx.gov or 512-238-8683.",
